Atmospheric Sounds — copyright, licensing, and attribution
==========================================================

Original Luanti port contributions and original artwork:
Copyright (c) NeoSparkServers.

The files `icon.png` and `icon/Atmospheric soundsL.png` are original artwork by
NeoSparkServers. Both images are distributed under LGPL-3.0-only, as confirmed
by their author. The root icon is a copy of the other image.

The Luanti port is based on the AmbientSounds project by CreativeMD and its
contributors. The checked upstream Fabric metadata credits CreativeMD and
AriaFreeze and declares LGPL-3.0-only. The original Minecraft source tree is
not bundled in this repository. See NOTICE for attribution and sources.

All 120 files in `sounds/` are renamed and re-encoded files corresponding to
CreativeMD/AmbientSounds audio. The upstream project declares LGPL-3.0-only.
The complete mapping, verification method, applicable attribution, and limits
of what is known about the recordings are in SOUND_PROVENANCE.md. Do not assume
that CreativeMD personally recorded every sound or that the port's verification
establishes the original source and rights of every recording.

