- LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt — GNU General Public License, version 3, incorporated
  by reference into LGPL version 3.

Third-party credits, the source reference, and remaining provenance limitations
are part of this licensing notice: see NOTICE and SOUND_PROVENANCE.md.
